        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(d) Under no circumstances will the Optional Termination Pay be greater than $30,500. An employee who is receiving Optional Termination Pay shall not be eligible to the Termination Pay provided for laid off employees under the terms of the applicable collective bargaining agreement.",
