                    385.0,
                    777.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) Extended Compensation Payments shall be based on the methods used to compute termination allowance as determined by the applicable Collective Bargaining Agreement for the position held by the employee immediately prior to reassignment to the JMC. Such payments are subject to deduction of appropriate taxes and Union dues as applicable.",
